      "body": "## Motivation\n\n`ServerArgs.load_config_file()` returned YAML and JSON roots without validating that they were mappings. Empty or null documents therefore returned `None`, while list and scalar roots failed later in CLI merging with errors such as `TypeError: 'bool' object is not iterable`.\n\nFixes #45182.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Normalize YAML/JSON null roots (including empty and comment-only YAML) to an empty config.\n- Reject list and scalar roots with a clear `ValueError` that identifies the received type and config path.\n- Preserve valid mappings, CLI-over-config precedence, and existing parser/file-format exceptions.\n- Add focused YAML, JSON, and real serve CLI regression coverage.\n\nThis contribution was prepared with AI assistance. The behavior and tests described below were executed in an isolated CPU environment.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable. This only validates configuration document roots and does not change model outputs.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable. This code runs once while loading CLI configuration.\n\n## Tests\n\n```text\nSGLANG_CACHE_DIR=/tmp/sglang-45182-cache HF_HOME=/tmp/sglang-45182-hf PYTHONPATH=python \\\n  .venv/bin/python python/sglang/multimodal_gen/test/unit/test_server_args.py TestServerArgsPathExpansion\n# Ran 44 tests in 0.447s — OK\n\nPRE_COMMIT_HOME=/tmp/sglang-45182-precommit .venv/bin/pre-commit run --all-files\n# Passed (all applicable hooks, including Rust formatting and clippy)\n```\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the contribution guide.\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the contribution guide.\n- [x] Update documentation according to the contribution guide. (No documentation change is needed for this validation fix.)\n- [x] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to the contribution guide. (Not applicable; rationale above.)\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style guidance.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39266616682](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39266616682)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39266615209](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39266615209)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39266615147](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39266615147)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
